  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "四人分别承担进攻、防御与支援职责，用角色能力协同适应持续变化的战场压力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "4-Player Co-op Assemble a squad of distinct combat roles and push through relentless enemy waves together. Combine offensive, defensive, and support abilities to create powerful team synergies and adapt to any battlefield challenge",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2454600/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每台泰坦拥有独特武器与攻击模式，炮塔、导弹齐射、脉冲和重炮要求精确构筑与团队配合。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each Titan is a lethal war machine with unique weaponry and combat patterns. Turrets, missile barrages, pulse attacks, and devastating heavy artillery will demand perfectly tuned builds, seamless coordination, and smart tactics from your team",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2454600/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "摧毁建筑、桥梁与掩体来改造战场，也可能在队友脚下意外制造灾难。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Level buildings, collapse bridges, blast through cover, and use environmental destruction to your advantage - or trigger disasters right beneath your allies' feet",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2454600/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
